      "id": "claim_72f3312a1c4a494889542dc6efdbf940",
      "statement": "BaseTool is the abstract base class extending RunnableSerializable that defines the contract for all LangChain tools, requiring name (identifier), description (guide text), and args_schema (Pydantic model or JSON schema) properties.",
