      "id": "claim_2d9e758d50e5458eacd5540485f12310",
      "statement": "Tool input validation is built on Pydantic models generated from function signatures via create_schema_from_function(), with schema sources prioritized as: explicit args_schema → JSON dict → inferred from function signature, and injected arguments (InjectedToolArg, InjectedToolCallId, ToolRuntime) are automatically excluded from model-facing schemas but re-injected at runtime.",
